{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23392","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和雨中花 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和雨中花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真宰倒持生杀柄，闲物命长人短命。\n松枝上鹤蓍下龟，千年不死仍无病。\n人生不得似龟鹤，少去老来同旦暝。\n何异花开旦暝间，未落仍遭风雨横。\n草得经年菜连月，唯花不与多时节。\n一年三百六十日，花能几日供攀折。\n桃李无言难自诉，黄莺解语凭君说。\n莺虽爲说不分明，叶底枝头谩饶舌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}